  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Litsemba Rising:Campus Sexual Harassment Prevention Intervention</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity supports efforts to combat sexual harassment at the University of Eswatini, grossly affecting women and marginalized groups. This project seeks to engage 1200 students in advocacy, education, and positive norm-building. Activities of this quarter include; Engagement with UNESWA Senior management, Engagement with UNESWA Lecturers, Unlimited Interact Club Wave 2 roll out, &#x2060;Media Engagement and &#x2060;Collective Care. The project aims at strengthening efforts to enhance learners&#x2019; safety and well-being in Higher Education Institutions (HEIs). It aligns with SDG 5 (Gender Equality) and national efforts to combat gender-based violence in Eswatini.</narrative>
  </description>
